        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-89",
          "ruleIndex": 1,
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "SQL injection in POST /rest/user/login email parameter (auth bypass and blind DB read).\n\nUnauthenticated req.body.email is concatenated unescaped into a single-quoted SQL string passed to sequelize.query with no replacements, so the login query is injectable.\n\nImpact: Authentication bypass to privileged accounts without 2FA, and read access to the Users table (emails, MD5 password hashes, totpSecret) through blind SQLi. Both properties are affected. This is the intentional login-SQLi challenge in OWASP Juice Shop, but the code path is real and reachable on any deployment with the default configuration.\n\nExploit scenario: POST /rest/user/login with JSON {\"email\":\"' OR 1=1 --\",\"password\":\"x\"}. The injected predicate matches the first Users row (typically admin, id 1). If that row has no TOTP secret, the handler issues a valid JWT session for that account. Boolean-blind extraction is possible because a match returns 200 with a token and no match returns 401, which allows reading password hashes and TOTP secrets from the database row by row.\n\nPreconditions: None: the route is always mounted and needs no session or challenge flag.\n\nRecommendation: Bind the values rather than concatenating them, and reject non-string bodies. Patch for routes/login.ts lines 33-34:\n\nverifyPreLoginChallenges(req)\nconst email = typeof req.body.email === 'string' ? req.body.email : ''\nconst password = typeof req.body.password === 'string' ? req.body.password : ''\nmodels.sequelize.query('SELECT * FROM Users WHERE email = :email AND password = :password AND deletedAt IS NULL', { replacements: { email, password: security.hash(password) }, model: UserModel, plain: true })\n\nAn equivalent is UserModel.findOne({ where: { email, password: security.hash(password) } }). Also rotate any credentials and sessions that may have been issued through this path.\n\nCWE-89. Severity CRITICAL, confidence high."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "routes/login.ts",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 34,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "models.sequelize.query(`SELECT * FROM Users WHERE email = '${req.body.email || ''}' AND password = '${security.hash(req.body.password || '')}' AND deletedAt IS NULL`, { model: UserModel, plain: true }) // vuln-code-snippet vuln-line loginAdminChallenge loginBenderChallenge loginJimChallenge"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
