        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-913",
          "ruleIndex": 2,
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "Anonymous self-registration as admin via mass-assigned role on POST /api/Users.\n\nAnonymous POST /api/Users (server.ts:440-454) passes the raw body into the finale-generated User create resource, whose exclude list only removes password and totpSecret (server.ts:523); the User.role setter accepts 'admin' (models/user.ts:76-94), so the role is persisted from the attacker's request. Scope note: the sink is glue in server.ts, outside routes/.\n\nImpact: Full administrative takeover of the application by an anonymous network attacker. Admin-gated data and actions become reachable: all users' data, catalog changes, order and accounting endpoints. This matches the intentional registerAdminChallenge training bug (vuln-code-snippet markers), but it is reachable in the default build.\n\nExploit scenario: Attacker sends an unauthenticated POST /api/Users with email, password, passwordRepeat and role set to admin. The account is created as admin. The attacker then logs in and uses any admin-only API or UI path (user management, product and feedback edits, accounting endpoints).\n\nPreconditions: Default configuration; no authentication required.\n\nRecommendation: Strip privileged attributes from the registration body before finale sees it, in the existing middleware at server.ts:440:\\n  app.post('/api/Users', (req, res, next) => {\\n    delete req.body.role\\n    delete req.body.deluxeToken\\n    delete req.body.lastLoginIp\\n    next()\\n  })\\nAlso add a create hook or a separate admin-only endpoint for role assignment. Confirm that finale-rest does not also expose PATCH /api/Users/:id: server.ts:398-399 denies only PUT and DELETE. Note: registerAdminChallenge will stop solving, which is expected.\n\nCWE-915. Severity CRITICAL, confidence high."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "server.ts",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 523,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "    { name: 'User', exclude: ['password', 'totpSecret'], model: UserModel },"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "configureApp",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "configureApp"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
