        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-639",
          "ruleIndex": 6,
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "Passkey registration overwrites another user's credential public key.\n\nregisterVerify looks up an existing passkey by the client-supplied credentialID with no ownership check and then rewrites its publicKey. An authenticated user can replace another user's passkey key material using that user's credential ID, which is exposed by the unauthenticated login-options endpoint.\n\nImpact: Account takeover of any passkey-enrolled user by any registered user, persisting across the victim's own logins.\n\nExploit scenario: Attacker registers their own account, obtains the victim credential ID from POST /rest/passkey/login-options, and calls register-verify with an attestation (attestationType none) whose credential id equals it and whose public key is the attacker's. The victim row now holds the attacker key; the attacker then passkey-logs in as the victim because the lookup keys on credentialID and the session uses passkey.UserId.\n\nPreconditions: Attacker holds a normal account (any role); Victim has a registered passkey whose credential ID is discoverable from login-options.\n\nRecommendation: Never mutate an existing credential. Reject when the credential ID already exists:\n\nif (existing) { res.status(409).json({ error: 'credential already registered' }); return }\nawait PasskeyModel.create({ UserId: user.id, credentialID, publicKey, counter: credential.counter, transports, aaguid })\n\nAdd a unique index on passkeys.credentialID in models/passkey.ts.\n\nCWE-639. Severity HIGH, confidence high."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "routes/passkey.ts",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 142,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "existing.publicKey = publicKey // vuln-code-snippet vuln-line passkeyCredentialOverwriteChallenge"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "registerVerify",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "registerVerify"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "claudeSecurityPlugin": {
              "id": "F10",
