              "exploit_scenario": "Attacker registers their own account, obtains the victim credential ID from POST /rest/passkey/login-options, and calls register-verify with an attestation (attestationType none) whose credential id equals it and whose public key is the attacker's. The victim row now holds the attacker key; the attacker then passkey-logs in as the victim because the lookup keys on credentialID and the session uses passkey.UserId.",
