        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-20",
          "ruleIndex": 12,
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "Negative basket quantities produce negative totals that credit the wallet at checkout.\n\nBasket quantities are not checked for sign (basketItems.ts:95 accepts any value below stock), and placeOrder subtracts totalPrice from the wallet on line 150 when paymentId is wallet, so a negative total increases the balance. Also CWE-362: placeOrder reads the wallet balance (order.ts:148) and checks it (order.ts:149), then debits in a separate statement (order.ts:150) after many intervening awaits (per-item stock updates, delivery lookup, PDF stream). The basket is only destroyed later, in the PDF finish handler (order.ts:51), so concurrent requests on the same basket all read the same items and all pass the balance check before any debit lands. Reasoned from code, not executed.\n\nImpact: Unlimited wallet funds and stock manipulation through negative quantity updates on the stock table.\n\nExploit scenario: POST /api/BasketItems with quantity -50 for a product, check out with orderDetails.paymentId wallet; the wallet balance increases by the absolute total.\n\nPreconditions: authenticated account.\n\nRecommendation: Require integer quantity between 1 and limitPerUser on add and update; reject totals of 0 or less before any wallet operation. Also CWE-362: Make the check and debit one conditional statement and fail when no row is updated: `const [n] = await WalletModel.update({ balance: sequelize.literal(`balance - ${totalPrice}`) }, { where: { UserId: req.body.UserId, balance: { [Op.gte]: totalPrice } } }); if (n === 0) return next(new Error('Insufficient wallet balance.'))`. Also claim the basket atomically before payment (for example a conditional update that flips a checkedOut flag) so one basket cannot be checked out twice.\n\nCWE-20. Severity HIGH, confidence high."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "routes/order.ts",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 150,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "await WalletModel.decrement({ balance: totalPrice }, { where: { UserId: req.body.UserId } })"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "placeOrder",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "placeOrder"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "claudeSecurityPlugin": {
