              "recommendation": "Require integer quantity between 1 and limitPerUser on add and update; reject totals of 0 or less before any wallet operation. Also CWE-362: Make the check and debit one conditional statement and fail when no row is updated: `const [n] = await WalletModel.update({ balance: sequelize.literal(`balance - ${totalPrice}`) }, { where: { UserId: req.body.UserId, balance: { [Op.gte]: totalPrice } } }); if (n === 0) return next(new Error('Insufficient wallet balance.'))`. Also claim the basket atomically before payment (for example a conditional update that flips a checkedOut flag) so one basket cannot be checked out twice.",
