        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-862",
          "ruleIndex": 16,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Product catalog writable without authentication via PUT /api/Products/:id.\n\nThe authentication guard on PUT /api/Products/:id is commented out, and the finale resource for Product registers PUT /api/Products/:id with no middleware (server.ts:524, 540-546), so anonymous requests reach the update handler. The sink is the route line that lacks the guard. Scope note: the route wiring is in server.ts.\n\nImpact: Unauthenticated integrity compromise of the catalog: price manipulation, product defacement and possible stored XSS served to all users. This is the intentional changeProductChallenge training bug, but it is reachable in the default build.\n\nExploit scenario: Anonymous attacker sends PUT /api/Products/<id> with a JSON body setting price to 0 or changing name and description. All customers then see the tampered product, and descriptions rendered without sanitization can carry stored XSS.\n\nPreconditions: Default configuration; no authentication required.\n\nRecommendation: Restore the guard and restrict it to admins. Add to lib/insecurity.ts:\\n  export const isAdmin = () => (req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) => {\\n    const decoded = verify(utils.jwtFrom(req)) && decode(utils.jwtFrom(req))\\n    return decoded?.data?.role === roles.admin ? next() : res.status(403).json({ error: 'Forbidden' })\\n  }\\nThen in server.ts:\\n  app.put('/api/Products/:id', security.isAuthorized(), security.isAdmin()).\n\nCWE-862. Severity MEDIUM, confidence high."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "server.ts",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 402,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "  // app.put('/api/Products/:id', security.isAuthorized()) // vuln-code-snippet vuln-line changeProductChallenge"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "configureApp",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "configureApp"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
