        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-863",
          "ruleIndex": 21,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "CAPTCHA answer is returned alongside the challenge.\n\ncaptchas returns the full captcha object including answer (lines 24-31), which verifyCaptcha then compares against (line 38), so any client can read the solution before submitting.\n\nImpact: Anti-automation controls on feedback and data export are bypassed.\n\nExploit scenario: GET /rest/captcha, read answer, POST feedback with the answer, and repeat for automated spam.\n\nPreconditions: none.\n\nRecommendation: Return only captchaId and the rendered challenge; keep the answer server-side; fail closed when no matching captcha exists.\n\nCWE-804. Severity MEDIUM, confidence high."
          },
