        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-863",
          "ruleIndex": 21,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Deluxe role granted without payment when paymentMode is omitted or unrecognized.\n\nPayment is verified only inside the paymentMode === 'wallet' (lines 24-32) and paymentMode === 'card' (lines 34-40) branches. Any other value, including an absent one, skips both. The role change at line 43 then runs unconditionally. appendUserId (server.ts:669) binds UserId to the caller, so the grant applies to the caller's own account. Also CWE-862: Payment is only verified when paymentMode is exactly wallet (line 24) or card (line 34); any other or missing value skips payment and reaches the role update on line 43.\n\nImpact: Free deluxe membership and its pricing benefits. Bounded to the customer tier, not a full admin escalation.\n\nExploit scenario: A registered customer sends POST /rest/deluxe-membership with an empty body and their Bearer token. The role is set to deluxe, a new token is issued (lines 47-50), and the membership is granted free.\n\nPreconditions: Registered customer account.\n\nRecommendation: Default-deny before any state change: if (!['wallet', 'card'].includes(req.body.paymentMode)) { res.status(400).json({ status: 'error', error: 'Invalid payment mode' }); return }. Then perform the payment check and the role update in one transaction. Also CWE-862: Default-deny: if (!['wallet','card'].includes(req.body.paymentMode)) return 400; require the wallet row to exist and the balance to cover the fee before deducting.\n\nCWE-863. Severity MEDIUM, confidence high."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "routes/deluxe.ts",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 43,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "const updatedUser = await user.update({ role: security.roles.deluxe, deluxeToken: security.deluxeToken(user.email) })"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "upgradeToDeluxe",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "upgradeToDeluxe"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "claudeSecurityPlugin": {
              "id": "F41",
              "title": "Deluxe role granted without payment when paymentMode is omitted or unrecognized",
              "impact": "Free deluxe membership and its pricing benefits. Bounded to the customer tier, not a full admin escalation.",
              "file": "routes/deluxe.ts",
              "line": 43,
              "description": "Payment is verified only inside the paymentMode === 'wallet' (lines 24-32) and paymentMode === 'card' (lines 34-40) branches. Any other value, including an absent one, skips both. The role change at line 43 then runs unconditionally. appendUserId (server.ts:669) binds UserId to the caller, so the grant applies to the caller's own account. Also CWE-862: Payment is only verified when paymentMode is exactly wallet (line 24) or card (line 34); any other or missing value skips payment and reaches the role update on line 43.",
              "exploit_scenario": "A registered customer sends POST /rest/deluxe-membership with an empty body and their Bearer token. The role is set to deluxe, a new token is issued (lines 47-50), and the membership is granted free.",
              "preconditions": [
                "Registered customer account"
              ],
              "category": "Incorrect Authorization",
              "severity": "MEDIUM",
              "confidence": "high",
              "recommendation": "Default-deny before any state change: if (!['wallet', 'card'].includes(req.body.paymentMode)) { res.status(400).json({ status: 'error', error: 'Invalid payment mode' }); return }. Then perform the payment check and the role update in one transaction. Also CWE-862: Default-deny: if (!['wallet','card'].includes(req.body.paymentMode)) return 400; require the wallet row to exist and the balance to cover the fee before deducting.",
              "cwe_id": "CWE-863",
              "snippet": "const updatedUser = await user.update({ role: security.roles.deluxe, deluxeToken: security.deluxeToken(user.email) })",
              "symbol": "upgradeToDeluxe",
