        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-639",
          "ruleIndex": 6,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Unauthenticated review creation takes the review author from the request body.\n\nPUT /rest/products/:id/reviews has no isAuthorized middleware (server.ts:673) and stores req.body.author as the review owner. The authenticated identity computed at line 16 is only used to score a challenge (lines 17-20). Also CWE-345: PUT /rest/products/:id/reviews (server.ts:673) has no auth, and the review author is taken from req.body.author (line 26) rather than the session.\n\nImpact: Identity spoofing in user-generated content: attribution to arbitrary customers, reputational harm and social engineering.\n\nExploit scenario: An anonymous client PUTs {\"author\":\"<any customer email>\",\"message\":\"...\"} to any product. A review attributed to that customer appears in the public list, which impersonates them in user-generated content.\n\nPreconditions: None: unauthenticated network request.\n\nRecommendation: Require auth on the route (server.ts:673 add security.isAuthorized()). In the handler: const user = security.authenticatedUsers.from(req); if (!user) return res.status(401).json({ error: 'Unauthorized' }); then set author: user.data.email and ignore req.body.author. This removes the forgedReviewChallenge hook. Also CWE-345: Require security.isAuthorized() and set author: user.data.email on the server, ignoring the body.\n\nCWE-639. Severity MEDIUM, confidence high."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "routes/createProductReviews.ts",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 26,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "        author: req.body.author,"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "createProductReviews",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "createProductReviews"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
