        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-307",
          "ruleIndex": 13,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "TOTP second factor has no per-account attempt limit; the IP limiter is bypassable via X-Forwarded-For.\n\nPOST /rest/2fa/verify checks the 6-digit TOTP with no attempt counter on the tmpToken or account. The only throttle is the IP-keyed limiter at server.ts:490-492, which uses the default req.ip and is therefore client-controlled through X-Forwarded-For (see the server.ts:378 finding). The tmpToken stays valid for 6 hours (lib/insecurity.ts:54).\n\nImpact: Second factor bypassed once the password is known, giving full account takeover.\n\nExploit scenario: With the victim password, the attacker logs in to obtain a tmpToken (login.ts:37-46). They then send POST /rest/2fa/verify with each of the 10^6 six-digit codes, rotating X-Forwarded-For so the limiter never fires. A hit returns a full session.\n\nPreconditions: Victim password is known or guessed; Attacker completes the search within the tmpToken lifetime (6 hours).\n\nRecommendation: Count failed TOTP attempts per user (keyed on userId from the tmpToken, not IP) and lock out or invalidate the tmpToken after about 5 failures. Also record consumed codes per user so a valid code cannot be replayed inside the tolerance window. Patch sketch: const n = failedTotp.get(userId) ?? 0; if (n >= 5) return res.status(429).send(); ... if (!isValid) { failedTotp.set(userId, n + 1); return res.status(401).send() }; failedTotp.delete(userId).\n\nCWE-307. Severity MEDIUM, confidence high."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "routes/verify.ts",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 31,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "const isValid = verifySync({ secret: user.totpSecret, token: totpToken, epochTolerance: 30 }).valid"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "verify",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "verify"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "claudeSecurityPlugin": {
