        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-639",
          "ruleIndex": 6,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Order history is keyed by a vowel-masked email, which is not injective, so a look-alike address reads another customer's orders.\n\norderHistory queries orders by email.replace(/[aeiou]/gi,'*') (line 16). Orders are stored under the same masking (order.ts:170), which maps every vowel to '*' and so is not one-to-one. Two different addresses with the same consonants and vowel positions (for example bob@x.com and bab@x.com both give b*b@x.com) share one key. The data is stored and fetched by a non-unique key rather than by the immutable user id.\n\nImpact: Read another customer's order history (products, totals, address and payment ids). Requires knowing the victim's email pattern, so MEDIUM.\n\nExploit scenario: Attacker registers a look-alike address that masks to the same string as the victim's (for example jahn@x.com for john@x.com, which masks to j*hn@x.com) and calls GET /rest/order-history, which returns the victim's orders.\n\nPreconditions: Attacker knows the victim's email consonant and vowel-position pattern; Attacker can register a look-alike email.\n\nRecommendation: Store the immutable user id with each order and query by it: in placeOrder add `UserId: req.body.UserId` to the inserted document, and in orderHistory use `ordersCollection.find({ UserId: loggedInUser.data.id })`. Backfill existing documents. Do not use masked email as a lookup key.\n\nCWE-639. Severity MEDIUM, confidence high."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "routes/orderHistory.ts",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 17,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "const order = await ordersCollection.find({ email: updatedEmail })"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "orderHistory",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "orderHistory"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "claudeSecurityPlugin": {
