        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-287",
          "ruleIndex": 3,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Client-supplied couponData is trusted against a public campaign date, so past promotions can be reused indefinitely.\n\ncalculateApplicableDiscount decodes req.body.couponData from base64 and accepts it when the second field equals campaign.validOn. Those timestamps are constants in source (order.ts:209-219), and the expiry is never checked server-side. The security decision (granting a discount) relies on untrusted client input. The code is marked as a deliberate challenge (manipulateClockChallenge), but it is a real discount bypass.\n\nImpact: Price reduction of 40-75% on any order by reusing expired promotion codes. Bounded to discount amounts.\n\nExploit scenario: Attacker base64-encodes 'WMNSDY2019-<validOn>' and sends it as couponData on POST /rest/basket/:id/checkout. The 75% discount applies, and the same works for every past campaign at its published date.\n\nPreconditions: Any registered account.\n\nRecommendation: Remove the client-supplied couponData path, or issue campaign coupons server-side and verify an HMAC over (code, validOn) with a server-held secret. Also enforce that the campaign is active at the server time (Date.now() within its window) and single-use. Patch: `if (campaign && Date.now() <= campaign.expiresAt && verifyHmac(couponCode, couponDate, req.body.couponSig))`.\n\nCWE-807. Severity MEDIUM, confidence high."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "routes/order.ts",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 201,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "if (campaign && couponDate == campaign.validOn) { // eslint-disable-line eqeqeq"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "calculateApplicableDiscount",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "calculateApplicableDiscount"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
