              "exploit_scenario": "A registered user base64-encodes 'WMNSDY2019-' followed by the validOn millisecond value from the public campaigns table (order.ts:210) and sends it as couponData in POST /rest/basket/:id/checkout with no stored basket coupon. The branch returns 75 (line 203) and the order is discounted. The same token can be reused on any order.",
