        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-639",
          "ruleIndex": 6,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Any authenticated user can read and delete other users' basket items.\n\nOnly authentication is enforced for /api/BasketItems/:id (server.ts:390-391), and the finale-generated GET and DELETE have no ownership check, so DELETE /api/BasketItems/:id removes any user's item by id. The covered handler routes/basketItems.ts:68 also looks up items by id only. Scope note: the route guard is in server.ts.\n\nImpact: Cross-user cart tampering and deletion, plus disclosure of other users' basket contents.\n\nExploit scenario: A logged-in customer iterates BasketItem ids and sends DELETE /api/BasketItems/<id> to empty other customers' baskets, or GET to read their contents (ProductId, quantity, BasketId).\n\nPreconditions: Any authenticated customer account.\n\nRecommendation: Require the item's Basket to belong to the caller before read or delete. Use BasketItemModel joined to BasketModel with where UserId equal to req.body.UserId (after appendUserId), and return 400 'Malicious activity detected.' on mismatch. Apply the same scoping to the list route at server.ts:390.\n\nCWE-639. Severity MEDIUM, confidence high."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "server.ts",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 391,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "  app.use('/api/BasketItems/:id', security.isAuthorized())"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "configureApp",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "configureApp"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
