          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Product id concatenated into a $where JavaScript expression on an anonymous endpoint.\n\nGET /rest/products/:id/reviews (server.ts:672) is unauthenticated, and req.params.id (line 31, truncated to 40 characters when noSqlCommandChallenge is enabled) is concatenated into $where on line 36.\n\nImpact: Anonymous denial of service of the whole server; code execution is possible if the in-process evaluator uses eval (MarsDB internals not inspected).\n\nExploit scenario: Request /rest/products/1 || (function(){while(true){}})()/reviews to run attacker JavaScript in the query evaluator; the loop blocks the event loop.\n\nPreconditions: non-Docker/Heroku runtime (noSqlCommandChallenge disabledEnv).\n\nRecommendation: Use an object query: db.reviewsCollection.find({ product: Number(req.params.id) }) and return 400 for non-integers. Never build $where from request data.\n\nCWE-943. Severity MEDIUM, confidence medium."
