            "text": "Order id concatenated into $where JavaScript on a public tracking endpoint.\n\nGET /rest/track-order/:id (server.ts:656) is public and req.params.id (line 15, truncated to 60 characters when reflectedXssChallenge is enabled) is embedded in a $where string on line 18.\n\nImpact: Anonymous read of all orders and possible DoS or code execution.\n\nExploit scenario: Send id x' || 1==1 || ' to return every order (email masked, products, addresses), or use the same JavaScript execution path as the showProductReviews finding.\n\nPreconditions: non-Docker/Heroku runtime (reflectedXssChallenge disabledEnv).\n\nRecommendation: Query with an object: db.ordersCollection.find({ orderId: String(req.params.id) }) and validate the xxxx-hex format with a regex.\n\nCWE-943. Severity MEDIUM, confidence medium."
