        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-522",
          "ruleIndex": 26,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Session JWT payload embeds the user's password hash and TOTP secret.\n\nafterLogin passes the full Sequelize user record (including password MD5 and totpSecret) as the JWT payload; UserModel has no toJSON override (models/user.ts), so jwt.sign serializes both secrets into the token that is returned to the client and cached. The same pattern repeats at routes/updateUserProfile.ts:40, routes/deluxe.ts:48, routes/passkey.ts:66 and routes/2fa.ts:42.\n\nImpact: Offline password cracking and permanent 2FA bypass for anyone who obtains a session token. The TOTP seed persists beyond the 6h token life.\n\nExploit scenario: Any party that obtains the token (XSS reading localStorage or the cookie, a leaked log or proxy record, a shared device) decodes the payload, takes the unsalted MD5 password hash for offline cracking and the TOTP seed to generate valid second-factor codes indefinitely, outliving session logout.\n\nPreconditions: Attacker obtains a valid session token by a separate means (XSS, cookie theft, log exposure).\n\nRecommendation: Build the token from an allowlist of session fields instead of the entity:\n\nconst SESSION_FIELDS = ['id','username','email','role','deluxeToken','lastLoginIp','profileImage','isActive'] as const\nconst data = Object.fromEntries(SESSION_FIELDS.map((f) => [f, user[f]]))\nconst token = security.authorize({ data, bid: basket.id })\n\nApply at updateUserProfile.ts:40, deluxe.ts:48, passkey.ts:66, 2fa.ts:42. Have changePassword.ts:39 compare against a fresh DB row instead of the cached payload. Add toJSON() to models/user.ts that strips password, totpSecret and deluxeToken.\n\nCWE-522. Severity MEDIUM, confidence medium."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "routes/login.ts",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 24,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "const token = security.authorize(authenticatedUser)"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "afterLogin",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "afterLogin"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "claudeSecurityPlugin": {
              "id": "F67",
              "title": "Session JWT payload embeds the user's password hash and TOTP secret",
              "impact": "Offline password cracking and permanent 2FA bypass for anyone who obtains a session token. The TOTP seed persists beyond the 6h token life.",
