              "recommendation": "Build the token from an allowlist of session fields instead of the entity:\n\nconst SESSION_FIELDS = ['id','username','email','role','deluxeToken','lastLoginIp','profileImage','isActive'] as const\nconst data = Object.fromEntries(SESSION_FIELDS.map((f) => [f, user[f]]))\nconst token = security.authorize({ data, bid: basket.id })\n\nApply at updateUserProfile.ts:40, deluxe.ts:48, passkey.ts:66, 2fa.ts:42. Have changePassword.ts:39 compare against a fresh DB row instead of the cached payload. Add toJSON() to models/user.ts that strips password, totpSecret and deluxeToken.",
              "cwe_id": "CWE-522",
              "snippet": "const token = security.authorize(authenticatedUser)",
              "symbol": "afterLogin",
