        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-613",
          "ruleIndex": 28,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Password reset and change do not revoke existing sessions, and cached tokens never expire.\n\nPassword updates in resetPassword and changePassword leave every token already in authenticatedUsers.tokenMap valid. The cache lookup (lib/insecurity.ts:77-79) ignores exp, and security.verify (jws.verify) does not check exp either, so a stolen session survives the reset and remains usable after the 6h JWT lifetime until the process restarts.\n\nImpact: Session persists across password reset and beyond the advertised 6h token life, undermining recovery.\n\nExploit scenario: Attacker holds a session token. The victim resets the password after suspecting compromise, but the attacker token still maps to the victim record and keeps working for requests that use the cache.\n\nPreconditions: Attacker holds a previously issued session token.\n\nRecommendation: On reset and change, revoke all sessions for the user:\n\nfor (const [t, s] of Object.entries(security.authenticatedUsers.tokenMap)) { if (s.data.id === user.id) delete security.authenticatedUsers.tokenMap[t] }\ndelete security.authenticatedUsers.idMap[user.id]\n\nAlso check exp in authenticatedUsers.get() so cached sessions expire with the JWT.\n\nCWE-613. Severity MEDIUM, confidence medium."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "routes/resetPassword.ts",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 44,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "const updatedUser = await user.update({ password: newPassword })"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "resetPassword",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "resetPassword"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
