        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-94",
          "ruleIndex": 8,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Attacker-supplied JavaScript evaluated by notevil sandbox in the B2B order endpoint.\n\nbody.orderLinesData is passed to notevil safeEval inside a Node vm context, and notevil plus vm are not a security boundary.\n\nImpact: Guaranteed server-side occupation (busy loop up to 2 s per request) by any registered user. Code execution if notevil can be escaped, which is unverified.\n\nExploit scenario: A registered customer POSTs /b2b/v2/orders with orderLinesData set to a JavaScript expression. The expression runs inside the sandbox. A busy loop occupies the server for up to 2 seconds per request. A sandbox escape would give code execution in the server process.\n\nPreconditions: Any valid JWT: the /b2b/v2 prefix is behind security.isAuthorized() (server.ts:456), so this is not unauthenticated as the threat model assumed; rceChallenge or rceOccupyChallenge enabled: disabledEnv Docker, Heroku, Windows; Full RCE would also need a notevil sandbox escape, which was not verified; notevil source is not in the checkout.\n\nRecommendation: Remove the evaluation. Treat orderLinesData as data: JSON.parse plus schema validation (for example zod) on the fields actually used, and drop notevil and the vm.runInContext call.\n\nCWE-95. Severity MEDIUM, confidence medium."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "routes/b2bOrder.ts",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 23,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "vm.runInContext('safeEval(orderLinesData)', sandbox, { timeout: 2000 })"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "b2bOrder",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "b2bOrder"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
