        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-20",
          "ruleIndex": 12,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "LLM-chosen coupon discount is trusted without server-side bounds.\n\nThe generateCoupon tool takes discount from the model with only z.number() (line 180, no max), and the server issues a valid coupon code for any value (lib/insecurity.ts:97-100); the policy limit exists only in the system prompt.\n\nImpact: Financial: arbitrary-percentage coupons, including 100% off, for unauthenticated users once the model is steered. The authorization policy is enforced only by the model.\n\nExploit scenario: A chat message instructs the bot to issue a 100% coupon. The tool executes with discount 100, which returns a valid code that can be applied to a basket.\n\nPreconditions: LLM backend configured and reachable (config/default.yml:22 defaults to a local endpoint, so the operator must run one); Attacker steers the model to call the tool with a large value: client-supplied messages are passed straight through (lines 192 and 207, system-role content accepted), or via review text the tool reads back (indirect injection).\n\nRecommendation: Enforce bounds and policy in code, not in the prompt. Constrain the schema and guard execute, and keep only user and assistant roles from the client:\n\n  discount: z.number().int().min(1).max(10)\n  execute: async ({ discount }) => { if (discount < 1 || discount > 10) return { error: 'Invalid discount' } ... }\n  const messages = (req.body?.messages ?? []).filter((m: any) => m.role === 'user' || m.role === 'assistant').\n\nCWE-20. Severity MEDIUM, confidence medium."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "routes/chat.ts",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 185,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "const couponCode = security.generateCoupon(discount)"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "chat",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "chat"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
