        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-639",
          "ruleIndex": 6,
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "PUT /api/BasketItems/:id loads any basket item with no ownership check before handing off to the generic update.\n\nquantityCheckBeforeBasketItemUpdate fetches the item by req.params.id and never compares item.BasketId to the requester's basket. It then calls next() (lines 78-80 when no quantity is sent, or after quantityCheck), which reaches the finale-generated BasketItem update (server.ts:540-550, no update hook). The route only has appendUserId (server.ts:458), so any authenticated user can change another user's basket item's quantity or move it into their own basket.\n\nImpact: Integrity of other users' baskets: quantities altered and items moved between baskets.\n\nExploit scenario: Attacker sends PUT /api/BasketItems/<victim item id> with {\"quantity\":5} or {\"BasketId\":<attacker basket id>}. The item is updated or moved without any ownership check.\n\nPreconditions: Any registered account; Item ids are sequential integers.\n\nRecommendation: After loading the item, load its basket scoped to the caller and return 404 unless it is owned: `const basket = item && await BasketModel.findOne({ where: { id: item.BasketId, UserId: req.body.UserId } }); if (!basket) return res.status(404).json({ status: 'error' })`. Also reject any body BasketId that is not one of the caller's baskets.\n\nCWE-639. Severity LOW, confidence high."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "routes/basketItems.ts",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 68,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "const item = await BasketItemModel.findOne({ where: { id: req.params.id } })"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "quantityCheckBeforeBasketItemUpdate",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "quantityCheckBeforeBasketItemUpdate"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
