          "ruleIndex": 5,
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "Prometheus metrics with business counters are served without authentication.\n\nGET /metrics (server.ts:716) returns the registry, including order counts, user counts by role and total wallet balance (metrics.ts:188-216), to anyone.\n\nImpact: Business telemetry disclosure to anonymous users.\n\nExploit scenario: GET /metrics and read total wallet balance, customer and deluxe counts, and solved-challenge progress.\n\nPreconditions: none.\n\nRecommendation: Require auth or an internal-only listener, and remove business gauges from the public registry.\n\nCWE-200. Severity LOW, confidence high."
          },
