              "exploit_scenario": "One account sends about 20 parallel POST /rest/products/reviews requests for the same review id. Each passes the check, likesCount rises by up to 20 and likedBy can hold duplicate entries.",
              "preconditions": [
                "A registered account (isAuthorized at server.ts:675)"
