              "recommendation": "Use one conditional atomic update: db.reviewsCollection.update({ _id: id, likedBy: { $ne: user.data.email } }, { $inc: { likesCount: 1 }, $push: { likedBy: user.data.email } }), and reject when modified is 0. Confirm that marsdb supports those operators. Otherwise serialise per review with a mutex. Remove the artificial sleep.",
