          "message": {
            "text": "Prometheus /metrics endpoint is unauthenticated and exposes business totals.\n\nGET /metrics (server.ts:716) has no authentication. The registry, populated by the updateLoop (metrics.ts:163-223), includes order counts, customer and deluxe counts, total wallet balance, feedback and complaint counts, and the cheat score. The response is written at line 92.\n\nImpact: Business-intelligence leakage that helps targeting. No direct data compromise.\n\nExploit scenario: An anonymous client scrapes /metrics and reads aggregate customer counts, order volume and wallet totals.\n\nPreconditions: None: unauthenticated request.\n\nRecommendation: Restrict /metrics to internal scrapers: check req.ip against an allowlist or require a scrape token. Keep the exposed-metrics challenge only if intended.\n\nCWE-306. Severity LOW, confidence high."
