        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-639",
          "ruleIndex": 6,
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "Any authenticated user can delete any customer's feedback.\n\nThe only guard on /api/Feedbacks/:id is isAuthorized() (server.ts:393), and DELETE is not denied (only PUT is, at server.ts:465), so the finale delete runs for any feedback id with no owner check. Scope note: server.ts glue.\n\nImpact: Integrity loss of customer feedback. Limited to feedback records.\n\nExploit scenario: A logged-in customer sends DELETE /api/Feedbacks/<id> for other customers' reviews to remove them.\n\nPreconditions: Any authenticated customer account.\n\nRecommendation: Deny DELETE for non-admins: app.delete('/api/Feedbacks/:id', security.isAdmin()) or security.denyAll() if deletion is not a product feature.\n\nCWE-639. Severity LOW, confidence high."
          },
