              "recommendation": "Set SameSite=Lax (or Strict) on the token cookie (res.cookie('token', token, { sameSite: 'strict' })), and require a CSRF token or enforce Origin/Sec-Fetch-Site checks on state-changing cookie-authenticated routes (/profile POST, /dataerasure POST). Make the cookie httpOnly if the frontend does not read it from JavaScript.",
              "cwe_id": "CWE-352",
              "snippet": "const loggedInUser = security.authenticatedUsers.get(req.cookies.token)",
              "symbol": "updateUserProfile",
              "declared_line": 17,
