        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-200",
          "ruleIndex": 5,
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "whoami fields parameter returns any user attribute, and JSONP exposes it cross-origin.\n\nWith a fields query, the handler copies any attribute of the cached user into the response, including password and totpSecret. The JSONP branch (res.jsonp at line 58) allows a cross-origin script to read the result when the cookie is sent, which depends on SameSite behaviour (no SameSite is set on the token cookie).\n\nImpact: Password hash and TOTP seed disclosure to a third-party origin in browsers that send the cookie cross-site.\n\nExploit scenario: Victim visits an attacker page; a script tag loads /rest/user/whoami?fields=password,totpSecret&callback=cb and the attacker reads the hash and TOTP seed. Works where the token cookie is sent cross-site.\n\nPreconditions: Victim browser sends the token cookie on a cross-site script request; Victim visits the attacker page while logged in.\n\nRecommendation: Allowlist the fields that may be requested and drop the JSONP branch for credential-bearing responses:\n\nconst ALLOWED = ['id','email','username','lastLoginIp','profileImage'] as const\nif (!ALLOWED.includes(field)) continue\n\nRemove the res.jsonp path. Set SameSite=Strict on the token cookie.\n\nCWE-200. Severity LOW, confidence medium."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "routes/currentUser.ts",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 31,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "baseUser[field] = user?.data[field as keyof typeof user.data]"
                  }
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "retrieveLoggedInUser",
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "retrieveLoggedInUser"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "claudeSecurityPlugin": {
              "id": "F88",
              "title": "whoami fields parameter returns any user attribute, and JSONP exposes it cross-origin",
